11. The Animatronic Test

A simple diagnostic procedure is proposed.

Place an institutional adult before the following four observations:

Observation A

Homes require substantially larger multiples of earnings than they did during earlier periods.

Observation B

Technology executives publicly predict significant occupational displacement.

Observation C

Young adults report anxiety about their economic futures.

Observation D

Young adults display weaker attachment to traditional career and ownership milestones.

Then observe the response.

Functional Human Response

“Those phenomena may be related.”

Metaphorically Animatronic Response

“TikTok.”

If the subject also mentions avocado toast, the diagnosis may be regarded as confirmed.

